      <marc:subfield code="a">Preface -- Acknowledgments -- Introduction -- What&apos;s wrong -- Why is love so hard? -- The devil&apos;s in the details -- Your worst nightmare -- Your fear cycle -- How to make it right -- Change your part -- Three dangers, three opportunities -- Your childhoods -- Asking them to change -- Common problems -- Your best dream -- Your love cycle -- Exercises -- Appendices -- Appendix A: Frequently asked questions -- Appendix B: Getting help.</marc:subfield>
